  characterName: Slick
  description: "Slick found motorbike racing the same way he found every great record:
    through a friend, at an unreasonable hour, in a place he wasn\u2019t supposed
    to be. The first time he rode a streetfighter at full throttle, the limiter bash
    felt like a bass kick that started in his chest and didn\u2019t stop. He was
    hooked."
